    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Minister of Power and Energy on 17th of May, 2022\n\n(Published in the Gazette on May 04, 2022)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPrice : Rs. 12.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n[Bill No. 117]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nBILL\n\nA\n\nSRI LANKA ELECTRICITY (AMENDMENT)\n\nto amend the Sri Lanka Electricity Act, No. 20 of 2009\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2: This clause amends section 8 of the Sri Lanka Electricity Act, No. 20 of2009 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effect of thesection as amended is to allow any person to participate in a bidding process for thegeneration of electricity.\n\nClause 3: This clause amends section 9 of the principal enactment and the legal effectof the section as amended is -\n\n(a) to allow any person to apply for the issue of a generation licence to generateelectricity; and\n\n(b) to take away the restriction imposed on a person to be eligible to apply for theissue of a generation licence to generate electricity over and above thegeneration capacity of 25 M.W. and also to allow any person to apply for thesame without any demarcation on the generation capacity.\n\nClause 4: This clause amends section 43 of the principal enactment and the legaleffect of the section as amended is -\n\n(a) the repeal of subsection (3) thereof as an consequential amendment made inrelation to the amendment made to subsection (1) of section 9; and\n\n(b) to expand the application of the provisions of the proviso to any existinggeneration plant that is to be developed and also to rectify an omission in thatsubsection.\n\nSri Lanka Electricity (Amendment)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nShort title\n\nL.D.\u2013O. 8/2019\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE SRI LANKA ELECTRICITYACT, NO. 20 OF 2009"
  },
