    "chunk_size_bytes": 1682,
    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPrice : Rs. 18.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n[Bill No. 120]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nJAYAMAGA DEVELOPMENT, SOCIAL SERVICESAND CHARITY FOUNDATION(INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate the Jayamaga Development, Social Services andCharity Foundation\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPresented by Hon. Hector Appuhamy, M. P. for Puttalam Districton 08th of June, 2022\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n(Published in the Gazette on April 25, 2022)\n\nJayamaga Development, Social Services andCharity Foundation (Incorporation)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE JAYAMAGA DEVELOPMENT,SOCIAL SERVICES AND CHARITY FOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS an Society called and known as the\u201cJayamaga Development, Social Services and CharityFoundation\u201d has heretofore been formed in Sri Lanka for thepurpose of effectually carrying out its objects and transactingall matters connected with the said Foundation according tothe rules agreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted several objects andmatters for which it was established, and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grantthe said application :\n\nBE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Jayamaga Development,Social Services and Charity Foundation (Incorporation) Act,No. of 2022."
  },
