    "chunk_size_bytes": 1951,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Raigampura CommunityDevelopment Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2022.\n\n3.(1) The general objects for which the body corporateis constituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)to formulate schemes for self-employment, toimplement and to direct such schemes;\n\nPreamble\n\nShort title\n\nIncorporationof theRaigamCommunityDevelopmentFoundation\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nThe generalobjects ofthe bodycorporate\n\n30\n\n2Raigampura Community Development Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n(b)to implement development activities such as roaddevelopment and construction of housing, hospitalsand community centres and to carry out theirmaintenance activities;\n\n(c)promotion of indoor welfare activities of thechildren, women and orphans as well as lookingafter the interests of the street children;\n\n(d)motivating the youth to engage in a self-employmentby providing training, loan facilities and a marketfor their products;\n\n(e)working towards a sustainable development byutilizing natural resources available in that areas ofrural and remote villages;\n\n(f)enhancing the agriculture, plantation and fisheriessectors with the utility of sophisticatedtechnological devices in order to promote better yield;\n\n(g)establishment of Information Technological centresto develop science education and thereby to devolopthe country;\n\n(h)to assist the implementation of governmentdevelopment activities in a way more benefits go topeople while preventing the wastage;\n\n(i)motivating and promoting human sports, literature,aesthetics and spiritual activities;\n\n(j)donating for the educational, religious, art and sportsfacility enhancement held without racial, religiousand caste differences as well as organizing variousfestivals and competitions;\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n3Raigampura Community Development Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25"
  },
