    "chunk_text": "(j)donating for the educational, religious, art and sportsfacility enhancement held without racial, religiousand caste differences as well as organizing variousfestivals and competitions;\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n3Raigampura Community Development Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(l)work in collaboration with similar interest local andforeign organizations.\n\n(2) specified in subsection (1) the Corporation shallensure that such implementation shall be carried out withoutany discrimination based on race, religion, language, caste,sex, political opinion, place of birth or any of such grounds.\n\n4.(1) The Body corporate shall have its own Fund.\n\n(2) All moneys received by way of gift, bequest, donation,subscription, contribution, fees or grants for an account ofthe body corporate shall be deposited in one or more banksapproved by the Board to the credit of the Corporation.\n\n(3) By utilizing that fund the following payments couldbe made:\u2013\n\n(a)the payments that shall be made under theexpenditure heads in carrying out activities of theboard of directors of the foundation and providingservices;\n\n(b)the allowancs for the staff;\n\n(c)payments made by the officials and volunteers forsome activities of the fund;\n\n(d)payments made for the postage, telegramme,telephone charges, stationery and for the printingexpenses;\n\nFund of thebody\n\nCorporate\n\n4Raigampura Community Development Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n(e)payments made to charities out of the monies setaside by the board of directors;\n\n(f)audit fee;\n\n(g)monies shall be paid for the office furniture. Furthera vehicle or several vehicles could be purchased orelse shall be hired;\n\n(h)bank accounts of the fund shall be maintained byChairman and the Treasurer two officials of the fundand the powers to sign cheques shall be held bythem.\n\n5.(1) The financial year of the body corporate shall bethe calendar year."
