    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Minister of Justice, Prison Affairs andConstitutional Reforms on 31st of August, 2022\n\n(Published in the Gazette on August 10, 2022)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n[Bill No. 145]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nBILL\n\nA\n\nHIGH COURT OF THE PROVINCES(SPECIAL PROVISIONS) (AMENDMENT)\n\nto amend the High Court of the Provinces (Special Provisions)Act, No. 19 of 1990\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This clause amends section 5A of the High Court of the Provinces (SpecialProvisions) Act, No. 19 of 1990, and the legal effect of the amendment is to enable theHigh Court of the Provinces to hear the appeals from the Small Claims Court.\n\n1High Court of the Provinces(Special Provisions) (Amendment)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\nShort titleand date ofoperation\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency\n\nL.D. \u2013 O. 62/2021\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE HIGH COURT OF THE PROVINCES(SPECIAL PROVISIONS) ACT, NO. 19 OF 1990\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -\n\n1. (1) This Act may be cited as the High Court of theProvinces (Special Provisions) (Amendment) Act, No. of2022.\n\n(2) The provisions of this Act shall come into operationon such date as the Minister may appoint by Order publishedin the Gazette.\n\n2. Section 5A of the High Court of the Provinces (SpecialProvisions) Act, No. 19 of 1990 is hereby amended asfollows: -\n\n(1)in subsection (1) thereof, by the substitution for thewords \u201cDistrict Court or a Family Court\u201d, of thewords \u201cDistrict Court, Family Court or Small ClaimsCourt\u201d and for the words \u201c District Court or FamilyCourt\u201d, of the words \u201cof a District Court, of a FamilyCourt or of a Small Claims Court\u201d;"
