    "chunk_text": "3.The objects of the Commission shall be:-\n\n(a) to provide the required forum for internationaland intellectual co-operation, through thefacilitation of a globally connected networkingsystem pertaining to field of competencies ofUNESCO ;\n\nEstablishmentof theSri LankaNationalCommissionfor UNESCO\n\nObjects oftheCommission\n\n25\n\nSri Lanka National Commission for UNESCO2\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(c) to assist the relevant ministries in the followup and monitoring of the implementation ofguidelines which are embodied in the widerange of UNESCO Conventions, to which SriLanka is a party;\n\n(d) to encourage and facilitate access to strategieswhich permit the acquisition of knowledgethrough information from research documents,publications and best practices amongstUNESCO beneficiaries; and\n\n(e) to assist in building capacities of the nationalinstitutions in education, science, culture, massmedia and communication by conductingworkshops, seminars and conferences.\n\n4. The powers, duties and functions of the Commissionshall be \u2013\n\n(a)to advice the Government of Sri Lanka on mattersrelating to UNESCO programmes and projects;\n\n(b)to promote and disseminate among UNESCObeneficiaries in Sri Lanka an understanding of theobjects, functions and purposes of UNESCOprogrammes and projects and to conduct meetings,seminars and lectures for that purpose;\n\n(c)to work towards the achievement of the objects ofthe Commission with the co-operation of therelevant government and local autonomous bodies,international non governmental organizations,United Nations agencies, governmental and nongovernmental organizations, private and publicsector institutions;\n\n(d)to organize programmes in the fields of education,science, culture, mass media, communication andother relevant disciplines including programmes\n\nPowers,duties andfunctions oftheCommission\n\n3Sri Lanka National Commission for UNESCO\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\nfocused on capacity building within the relevantministries and to assist in monitoring and evaluatingsuch programmes;"
