    "chunk_text": "Powers,duties andfunctions oftheCommission\n\n3Sri Lanka National Commission for UNESCO\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\nfocused on capacity building within the relevantministries and to assist in monitoring and evaluatingsuch programmes;\n\n(f)to disseminate information on and recommendcandidates for UNESCO awards, fellowships andstudy grants;\n\n(g)to mobilize and receive funds for theimplementation of programmes;\n\n(h)to open and maintain, current, savings and depositaccounts in any bank or banks;\n\n(i)to accept gifts, grants or donations from local orforeign sources, whether in cash or otherwise, forthe purpose of discharging the functions of theCommission:\n\nProvided that, notwithstanding anything to thecontrary in any other provisions of this Act, theCommission shall obtain prior written approval ofthe Department of External Resources in respect ofall foreign grants, gifts or donations in cash;\n\n(j)to acquire and hold, take or give on lease, mortgageor hire, pledge or sell or otherwise dispose of, anymovable or immovable property for the purpose ofdischarging the functions of the Commission; and\n\n(k)enter into and perform all such contracts as may benecessary for the exercise, performance anddischarge of the powers, duties and functions of theCommission.\n\nSri Lanka National Commission for UNESCO4\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n5. The Commission shall consist of-\n\n(a) the following ex- officio members, namely-\n\n(i) the Secretary to the Ministry of the Ministeror an additional Secretary of such Ministry;\n\n(ii) the Secretary to the Ministry of the Ministerassigned the subject of Higher Education oran additional Secretary of such Ministry;\n\n(iii) the Secretary to the Ministry of the Ministerassigned the subject of Technology or hisnominee;\n\n(iv) the Secretary to the Ministry of the Ministerassigned the subject of Cultural andReligious Affairs or his nominee;\n\n(v) the Secretary to the Ministry of the Ministerassigned the subject of Mass Media or hisnominee;"
