    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of October 07, 2022\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 13.10.2022)\n\nPrice : Rs. 30.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nA\n\nINSTITUTE OF DRAFTINGTECHNOLOGISTS SRI LANKA(INCORPORATION)\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. Gamini Waleboda, M. P.for Ratnapura District\n\nto incorporate the Institute of Drafting Technologists Sri Lanka\n\n(Private Members\u2019 Bill)\n\n1Institute of Drafting TechnologistsSri Lanka (Incorporation)\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE INSTITUTE OF DRAFTINGTECHNOLOGISTS SRI LANKA\n\nWHEREAS an Institute called and known as the \u201cInstituteof Drafting Technologists Sri Lanka\u201d has heretofore beenestablished for the purpose of administration, control andmaintenance of the vocational standards and discipline ofthe members of the Institute and generally for effectuallycarrying out its objects and transacting all matters connectedwith the said Institute according to the rules agreed to by itsmembers:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Institute has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established, and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be for the public advantage togrant the said application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Institute of DraftingTechnologists Sri Lanka Act, No. of 2022."
