    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of November 04, 2022\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 04.11.2022)\n\nAPPROPRIATION (AMENDMENT)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto amend the Appropriation Act, No. 30 of 2021\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\n2-2d\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Finance, Economic Stabilization and National Policies\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2: This clause amends paragraph (b) of subsection (1) of section 2 of the AppropriationAct, No. 30 of 2021 by amending the borrowing limit of rupees 3,844 billion to rupees4,507 billion.\n\nAppropriation (Amendment)1\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 36/2022\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE APPROPRIATION ACT, NO. 30 OF 2021\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Appropriation(Amendment) Act, No. of 2022.\n\n2.Section 2 of the Appropriation Act, No. 30 of 2021 asamended by Act, No. 21 of 2022 is hereby further amended inparagraph (b) of subsection (1) thereof, by the substitutionfor the words \u201crupees three thousand eight hundred fourtyfour billion\u201d, of the words \u201crupees four thousand five hundredseven billion\u201d.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nShort title\n\nSinhala text toprevail in caseof inconsistency\n\nAmendment ofsection 2 of Act,No. 30 of 2021\n\n5\n\n10\n\nAppropriation (Amendment)2\n\nDEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING"
