    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Hon. Premnath C. Dolawatte, Attorney at Law, M. P.for Colombo District on 08th of November, 2022\n\n(Published in the Gazette on October 14, 2022)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPrice : Rs. 15.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n[Bill No. 160]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nBILL\n\nA\n\nLOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS (AMENDMENT)\n\nto amend the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262)\n\n1 Local Authorities Elections (Amendment)\n\nShort title\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 262)\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Local AuthoritiesElections (Amendment) Act, No. of 2022.\n\n2.Section 28 of the main ordinance as amended bySection 8 of the Local Authorities Elections (Amendment)Act No. 16 of 2017 is amended as follows:\u2014\n\n(i) Subsection (2) of section 28 of the Principal Enactment,as amended by subsection (2) of Section 8 of the LocalAuthorities Elections (Amendment) Act, No. 16 of 2017is hereby removed and amended by substituting thefollowing section:\u2013\n\n\u201cIn subsection (2) of that section by the repeal ofthe words commencing from \u201cAny recongnizedpolitical party\u201d and ending with the words \u201csettingout the names:\u2013\u201d, and the substitution therefore ofthe following:\u2013"
