    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Minister of Ports, Shipping and Aviation on 05th of January, 2023\n\n(Published in the Gazette on November 10, 2022)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPrice : Rs. 10.00Postage : Rs. 50.00\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n[Bill No. 164]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nBILL\n\nA\n\nto amend the Licensing of Shipping Agents, Freight Forwarders,Non-Vessel Operating Common Carriers and Container OperatorsAct, No. 10 of 1972\n\nLICENSING OF SHIPPING AGENTS,FREIGHT FORWARDERS, NON-VESSELOPERATING COMMON CARRIERS ANDCONTAINER OPERATORS (AMENDMENT)\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This clause amends section 3 of the Licensing of Shipping Agents, FreightForwarders, Non-Vessel Operating Common Carriers and Container Operators Act, No.10 of 1972 and the legal effect of that section as amended is to provide for the Minister tomake regulations with respect of regulating the procedure for imposing and collectingcharge or levy imposed by the relevant service providers.\n\n1 Licensing of Shipping Agents, Freight Forwarders,Non-Vessel Operating Common Carriers andContainer Operators (Amendment)\n\nShort title\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nL.D.\u2013O. 21/2022\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE LICENSING OF SHIPPING AGENTS, FREIGHTFORWARDERS, NON-VESSEL OPERATING COMMON CARRIERS ANDCONTAINER OPERATORS ACT, NO. 10 OF 1972\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Licensing of ShippingAgents, Freight Forwarders, Non-Vessel Operating CommonCarriers and Container Operators (Amendment) Act,No. \u2026\u2026 of 2023.\n\n2. Section 3 of the Licensing of Shipping Agents, FreightForwarders, Non- Vessel Operating Common Carriers andContainer Operators Act, No. 10 of 1972 is hereby amendedin subsection (5) thereof as follows:-"
