    "chunk_text": "(j)to actively promote Human Resource Developmentinitiatives at the organizational level with a viewto the enhancement of the level of managerialcompetencies in organizations;\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n3Sri Lanka Institute of Training and Development(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(l)generally to do all such acts and things as arenecessary for, or incidental or conductive to, thecarrying out or the attainment of the objects of theInstitute;\n\n4. (1) The affairs of the Corporation shall, subject to therules in force for the time being of the Corporation, beadministered by an Executive Council consisting of theoffice-bearers and such other persons as may be provided forin such rules and elected in accordance therewith.\n\n(2) The first Executive Council of the Corporation shallbe the members of the Executive Council of the Instituteholding office on the day preceding the date ofcommencement of this Act.\n\n5. (1) It shall be lawful for the Corporation, from time totime, at any general meeting of the members and by a majorityof not less than two-thirds of the members present and entitledto vote, to make rules, not inconsistent with the provisionsof this Act or any other written law, for the admission,expulsion or withdrawal of members, for the election ofmembers of the Executive Council, for the conduct of theduties of the Executive Council and of the various officers,agents and servants of the Corporation, for the procedure tobe followed in the transation of business at meetings of theCorporation and the Executive Council and otherwisegenerally, for the management of the affairs of corporationand the attainment of its objects.\n\nManagementof the Affairsof theCorporation\n\nRules of theCorporation\n\n4Sri Lanka Institute of Training and Development(Incorporation)"
