    "chunk_text": "(a)provide for the payments of the levy on the gross collection and for the casinoentrance levy on instalments as provided for other levies; and\n\n(b)extend the application of certain provisions of the Inland Revenue Act, No. 24of 2017 being consequential to the application of clause 3.\n\nClause 6 : This clause amends section 7 of the principal enactment by the insertion ofthe new definitions for the words and expressions bookmaker, casino, citizen of Sri Lankaand Commissioner-General and Deputy Commissioner.\n\nClause 7 : This clause replaces the Schedule to the principal enactment by specifyingthe increased amounts to be paid for certain levies every year commencing on or afterApril 1,2023 on by a person carrying the business of a bookmaker or business of gaming.\n\nBetting and Gaming Levy (Amendment)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 17/2022\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE BETTING AND GAMING LEVYACT, NO. 40 OF 1988\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Betting and GamingLevy (Amendment) Act, No. of 2023.\n\n2.Section 2 of the Betting and Gaming Levy Act, No. 40of 1988 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d)as last amended by Act, No. 14 of 2015 is hereby furtheramended as follows: -\n\n(1)in subsection (1A) of that section-\n\n(a)in paragraph (a) of that subsection by thesubstitution for the words, \u201cfive per centum;or\u201d of the words, \u201cfive per centum;\u201d;\n\n(b)in paragraph (b) of that subsection by thesubstitution for the words and figures, \u201con orafter January 1, 2015, at the rate of ten percentum\u201d of the words and figures, \u201con or afterJanuary 1, 2015 but ending prior to April 1,2023 at the rate of ten per centum; or\u201d;\n\n(c)by the insertion immediately after paragraph(b) of that subsection of the following newparagraphs: -\n\n\u201c(c)for any year commencing on or afterApril 1, 2023, at the 