    "md5": "50411b78ca4d5e989925f145b18d3b0a",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1993,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefor, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Doctor ReverendHarispattuwe Ariyawangshalankara Thero Foundation(Incorporation) Act, No. of 2023.\n\nShort title\n\nPreamble\n\nIncorporation ofDoctor ReverendHarispattuweAriyawangshalankaraThero Foundation\n\n25\n\n2Doctor Reverend HarispattuweAriyawangshalankara Thero Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n(2) The body corporate shall be deemed to be a voluntarysocial service organization within the meaning and for thepurpose of the Voluntary Social Service Organizations(Registration and Supervision) Act, No. 31 of 1980 and theprovisions of that Act shall apply to and in relation to themanagement of the affairs of the Corporation.\n\n3. The body corporate shall operates exclusively as anot-for profit Organization and it is solely for the benefit ofthe society and its members.\n\n4. (1) The general objects for which the body corporate isconstituted are hereby declared to be:\u2014\n\n(a) to take action for the protection and perpetuation ofMaha Sanga;\n\n(b) to implement system to re-strength the relationshipsbetween the ordained and non-ordained; theprotections of the Sambuddha Sasana;\n\n(c) to implement programmes to make the monks andlaymen below the age of twenty a set of people whohave realized the Buddhist hood and relatedbehavioral patterns with proper judgmental skills;\n\n(d) to conduct and facilitating short, mid and long termmeditation training programs;\n\n(e) to conduct programmes in relation Buddhisteconomic, social, cultural, educational and ethicalconcepts in order to re-establish the Buddhist lifestyle;\n\n(f) to conduct effective programmes to wipe out alcoholand drugs;\n\nBodycorporateoperates as anot-for-profitOrganization\n\n25\n\nThe generalobjects of theBodycorporate\n\nDoctor Reverend HarispattuweAriyawangshalankara Thero Foundation (Incorporation)3\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n(g) to conduct rehabilitation, welfare and developmentprogrammes;"
  },
