    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of July 14, 2023\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 17.07.2023)\n\nPrice : Rs. 24.00Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nA\n\nJANARAJA FOUNDATION(INCORPORATION)\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. Harshana Rajakaruna, M. P.for Gampaha District\n\nto incorporate the Janaraja Foundation\n\n(Private Members\u2019 Bill)\n\n1Janaraja Foundation (Incorporation)\n\nPreamble\n\nShort title\n\nGeneralobjects of theFoundation\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE JANARAJA FOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS a Foundation called and known as the \u201cJanarajaFoundation\u201d has heretofore been formed established for thepurpose of effectually carrying out and transacting all mattersconnected with the said Foundation according to the rulesagreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be for the public advantage togrant the said application.\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Janaraja Foundation(Incorporation) Act, No. of 2023 and this non-governmentorganization which has been established for the purpose ofsocial welfare is called as Janaraja Foundation."
