    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. Eran Wickramaratne, M.P. on 18th of July, 2023\n\n(Published in the Gazette on July 07, 2023)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n[Bill No. 189]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nBILL\n\nA\n\nSPECIAL COMMODITY LEVY (AMENDMENT)\n\nto amend the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This Clause amends section 7 of the Principal Enactment so as to ensure thatany Order made by the Minister in terms of sections 2 or 5 of the Special Commodity LevyAct, No. 48 of 2007 will come into force only upon the approval thereof by Parliament.\n\n1Special Commodity Levy (Amendment)\n\n5\n\nShort title\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE SPECIAL COMMODITY LEVYACT, NO. 48 OF 2007\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Special Commodity Levy(Amendment) Act, No. of 2023.\n\n2.Section 7 of the Special Commodity LevyAct, No. 48 of 2007 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended by the deletion of paragraphs(i) to (iv) thereof, and the substitution therefore of thefollowing new paragraphs which shall take effect asparagraphs (i) and (ii) thereof:\u2014\n\n\u201c(i)be published in the Gazette, and shall as soon asconvenient thereafter be placed before Parliamentfor its approval;\n\n(ii)only come into force upon its approval byParliament.\u201d.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nAmendmentof section 7of Act,No. 48 of2007\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency\n\n10\n\n15\n\nSpecial Commodity Levy (Amendment)2\n\nDepartment of Government Printing"
