    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 195]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Minister of Justice, Prison Affairs andConstitutional Reforms on 08th of August, 2023\n\n(Published in the Gazette on July 11, 2023)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 18.00Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nELECTIONS (SPECIAL PROVISIONS)\n\nto provide for the extention of the time period for presentation of an Electionpetition and increase of fines; and to amend the Local Authorities ElectionsOrdinance (Chapter 262), the Parliamentary Elections Act, No. 1 of 1981,the Presidential Elections Act, No. 15 of 1981 and the Provincial CouncilsElections Act, No. 2 of 1988 and to provide for matters connected therewith or incidential thereto\n\nElections (Special Provisions)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\nShort title\n\nAmendmentof certainsections ofChapter 262specified inthe FirstSchedule\n\nAmendmentof section82AF of theprincipalenactment20\n\nL.D.-O. 9/2023\n\nAN ACT TO PROVIDE FOR THE EXTENTION OF THE TIME PERIOD FOR\n\nPRESENTATION OF AN ELECTION PETITION AND INCREASE OF FINES; AND\n\nTO AMEND THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE (CHAPTER262), THE PARLIAMENTARY ELECTIONS ACT, NO. 1 OF 1981, THEPRESIDENTIAL ELECTIONS ACT, NO. 15 OF 1981 AND THEPROVINCIAL COUNCILS ELECTIONS ACT, NO. 2 OF 1988 AND TO\n\nPROVIDE FOR MATTERS CONNECTED THEREWITH OR INCIDENTIAL\n\nTHERETO.\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Elections (SpecialProvisions) Act, No. \u2026\u2026. of 2023.\n\nPART I\n\nAMENDMENTS TO THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 262)"
