    "chunk_size_bytes": 1588,
    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 198]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nSRI LANKA COLLEGE OF NUTRITIONPHYSICIANS (INCORPORATION)\n\nPrice : Rs. 18.00Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nto incorporate the Sri Lanka College of Nutrition Physicians\n\nPresented by the Hon. (Dr.) Upul Galappaththi, M. P. for Hambanthota District on 10th of August, 2023\n\n( Published in the Gazette on July 12, 2023)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\n1Sri Lanka College of Nutrition Physicians(Incorporation)\n\nShort title\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE SRI LANKA COLLEGE OF NUTRITIONPHYSICIANS\n\nWHEREAS an college called and known as the \u201cSri LankaCollege of Nutrition Physicians\u201d has heretofore been formedin Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectually carrying out itsobjects and transacting all matters connected with the saidcollege according to the rules agreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said college has heretofore successfullycarried out and transacted the several objects and matters forwhich it was established and has applied to be incorporatedand it will be expedient to grant the said application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sri Lanka College ofNutrition Physicians (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2023."
  },
