    "md5": "059bf1fb391e9601be07e31a99442abc",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1992,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sri Lanka College ofNutrition Physicians (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2023.\n\n(2) The body corporate shall be deemed to be a VoluntarySocial Service Organization within the meaning and for thepurpose of the Voluntary Social Services Organizations(Registration and Supervision) Act, No. 31 of 1980 and theprovisions of that Act shall apply to and in relation to themanagement of the affairs of the Corporation.\n\nPreamble\n\nIncorporationof theSri LankaCollege ofNutritionPhysicians\n\n30\n\n2Sri Lanka College of Nutrition Physicians(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n3.The body corporate shall operates exclusively as anot-for profit Organization and it is solely for the benefit ofthe society and its members.\n\n4.The general objects for which the body corporate isconstituted are hereby declared to be:\u2014\n\n(a)to co-operate with other Associations, Colleges orindividuals, to promote the objectives of theassociation;\n\n(b)to provide advocacy for political leaders andadministrators regarding the nutrition related policyand programme planning within and outside theinstitution including Health Ministry; and\n\n(c)to do all such other acts/measures as may benecessary, incidental, conducive or convenient tothe attainment of the above aims and objectives ofthe body corporate.\n\n(2) In the implementation of the objects specified insubsection (1) the Corporation shall ensure that suchimplementation shall be carried out without anydiscrimination based on race, religion, language, caste, sex,political opinion, place of birth or any of such grounds.\n\n5.The objects of the body corporate shall be carriedout in such manner so as not to create any conflict betweenthe work of the Corporation and any work being carried outsimultaneously by any Ministry or Department of theGovernment or any Provincial Council.\n\nbodycorporateoperates as anot-for profitOrganization"
  },
