    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 197]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\npresented by the Hon. Harshana Rajakaruna, M. P.for Gampaha District on10 th of August, 2023\n\n(Published in the Gazette on July17, 2023)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 24.00Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nWw\n\nws\n\nJANARAJA FOUNDATION(INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate the Janaraja Foundation\n\n1Janaraja Foundation (Incorporation)\n\nPreamble\n\nShort title\n\nGeneralobjects of theFoundation\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE JANARAJA FOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS a Foundation called and known as the \u201cJanarajaFoundation\u201d has heretofore been established for the purposeof effectually carrying out and transacting all mattersconnected with the said Foundation according to the rulesagreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be for the public advantage togrant the said application.\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Janaraja Foundation(Incorporation) Act, No. of 2023 and this non-governmentorganization which has been established for the purpose ofsocial welfare is called as Janaraja Foundation."
