    "chunk_size_bytes": 1913,
    "chunk_text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Janaraja Foundation(Incorporation) Act, No. of 2023 and this non-governmentorganization which has been established for the purpose ofsocial welfare is called as Janaraja Foundation.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Foundation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)the achievement of human well-being without anyindifference to race, religion, caste etc.;\n\nIncorporationof theJanarajaFoundation\n\n30\n\n2Janaraja Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(b)eliminating poverty and identifying obstacles ofsocial existence and pioneering the humandevelopment;\n\n(c)dedicated for creating a Sri Lankan community whoare peaceful and friendly with mutual understandingand without any segregation;\n\n(d)contributing to creat a country full of well-disciplined citizens by joining to create a societywho mutually understood various religious valuesthat make human virtuous;\n\n(e)partaking to create a citizen who believes thatpatriotism can only be generated with the conceptof being a Sri Lankan citizen not with the conceptsof race, religion, caste or any other ethnicity;\n\n(f)attempting to create an assured human communityby convincing the notion that the vision of allreligious scholars is none other than humanreconciliation and social welfare;\n\n(g)socializing the idea that education shall not beinterfered by religion, economy, age, gender,background and any other factor and acting againstits obstacles;\n\n(h)protection, preservation, dissemination, evaluation,mutual understanding of cultural values and takingsteps to discard barriers existing to destroy themwithout any religious segregation;\n\n(i)pioneering and evaluating human thoughts andfeelings of all types of arts and crafts, aesthetics,their apreciation and undrstanding and identifyingand disposing obstacles existing against theirdissemination;\n\n3Janaraja Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25"
