    "chunk_size_bytes": 2026,
    "chunk_text": "(i) to do all other things as are necessary or expedientfor the proper and effective carrying out of theobjects of the Foundation;\n\n(j) It is the responsibility of every member to obey therecongnized rules of the Foundation.\n\n(2) The first Board of Management of the Foundationshall consist of members who held office prior to the date ofoperation of this Act.\n\n(3) The Board of Management shall consist of membersin the following hierarchical order\u2013\n\n(a)The Chairperson;\n\n(b)Three posts of Vice Chairpersons (appointed undervarious subjects);\n\n(c)The Registrar;\n\n(d)Three posts of Assistant Registrars (appointed undervarious subjects);\n\nStructure oftheFoundation\n\n5Janaraja Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(e)Organizational Secretary;\n\n(f)Financial Executive;\n\n(g)Assistant Financial Executive;\n\n(h)Executive Council (it is necessary to appoint anExecutive Council consisting of eight members).\n\n(4) General responsibilities of the Board ofManagement\u2013\n\n(a)The Chairperson\u2013\n\n(i)He shall be responsible for all the affairswith his leadership;\n\n(ii)He shall preside at every meeting of theBoard;\n\n(iii)He shall build up well-being and thecoordination of the Board of Management;\n\n(iv)He shall re-structure all the necessities;\n\n(v)He shall provide the necessary plans torequest and collect contributions, grants,donations and all forms of gifts that arenecessary for the purposes of theFoundation.\n\n(b)The Vice Chairpersons\u2013\n\n(i)In the absence of Chairperson, they shallperform the duties of the Chairperson inaccordance with his order;\n\n(ii)They shall organize and maintain theprojects assigned and conferred to them.\n\n6Janaraja Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n(c)The Registrar\u2013\n\n(i) He shall note all the records;\n\n(ii) He shall organize and record meetings;\n\n(iii) He shall maintain a proper coordinationamong the Board of Management;\n\n(iv) He shall record the documents of newproposals and projects and issue necessaryguidelines to carry out them.\n\n(d) Assistant Registrars (03 posts)\u2013"
