    "chunk_size_bytes": 1891,
    "chunk_text": "(iii) He shall maintain a proper coordinationamong the Board of Management;\n\n(iv) He shall record the documents of newproposals and projects and issue necessaryguidelines to carry out them.\n\n(d) Assistant Registrars (03 posts)\u2013\n\n(ii) They shall actively assits in every activityof the Registrar.\n\n(e) Organizational Secretary\u2013\n\nHe shall be responsible for organizing allthe special projects precisely and efficientlycarried out by the Organization.\n\n(f) Financial Executive\u2013\n\n(i) He shall administer all the finance;\n\n(ii) He shall maintain all the transactionsmethodically, economically, efficiently,precisely and transparently;\n\n(iii) He shall be responsible for maintaining andupdating records thereof;\n\n7Janaraja Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n(iv) He shall collect accurate data on financialmanagement and make the Board ofManagement aware of such reports.\n\n(g) Assistant Financial Executive\u2013\n\n(i) He shall fully assits in the affairs of theFinancial Executive;\n\n(ii) He shall act on behalf of the FinancialExecutive in his absentia.\n\n(h) Executive Council (it is necessary to appoint anExecutive Council consisting of eight members).\n\nThe following responsibilities of sub-topics shall beassigned and conferred to each Executive Assistant otherthan the collective responsibility of this Executive Council:\u2013\n\n(a) Economic and community services;\n\n(b) Fine arts, arts, aesthetics and literature;\n\n(c) Sports and traditional games, sports festivals andtournaments;\n\n(d) Religious and cultural affairs;\n\n(e) Agriculture, evaluation process of tradition andindigenousness;\n\n(f) Environment and wildlife activities;\n\n(g) Techniques of education and new technology;\n\n(h) Inspection of accounts;\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n8Janaraja Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n(5)Meetings of the Board of Management\u2013\n\n(a) The appointments of the Board ofManagement shall be in force for a period oftwo years;"
